          "type": "photo",
          "url": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/BTzuLZ9lBOtPBp4GDSu83Fh-Yuz6obOYNBGWaUUEKqqN5IJ6p6q1W-TCve9c9W65fekVSrsOu27GNuMPHQGbFc6n2d4VWl1OOjwbNbSKZ1HSoux-l1PfshUVbTPzAcLLUhro7Md6RebEKHv5xUbYdZOlKBh2wEPZ8Bz2DmrpO2-or2CZM4VkwlLk4prtaSlloO6-U6tV-r486ySGWR_IP1jitfjR9lVFLL0tPSoLxMiYvjAcFA6kQPkLMAJ9K4ghxXAkVhoM58whSgasHV871efL6ONMVg_gwWANi0QcNYXpU3OcEBkYB0NHvz7vkl12gDDY7dXpHvJhdAcReZSfZg.jpg"
